%% Brush path: pointer / Joy-Con to GPU stamp
sequenceDiagram
  participant SDL as platform/input
  participant App as game/app.cpp
  participant Region as PlayRegion
  participant Sim as SimPipeline
  participant Paint as paint.frag
  participant Tiles as ActiveTileMap

  SDL->>App: poll InputState\npointer / stick
  App->>Region: screen to sim coords\nqueryDrawableSize
  App->>Sim: paintDisk(cx,cy,r,mat)
  Sim->>Paint: dirty rect FBO pass
  Paint->>Sim: ping-pong tex swap
  Sim->>Tiles: markDisk + expand bounds
  Note over App: tickPlay fixed dt\nsubsteps x sim.step
